# Merge/patch artifacts
*.orig
*.rej
/patch.diff

# Cargo.lock is committed on purpose. This workspace ships binaries
# (aether-cli, aether-kernel), the Dockerfile COPYs the lockfile, and the CI
# cache key is hashFiles('**/Cargo.lock') — all three are broken without it.
# Ignoring it also let CI re-resolve every dependency to its newest compatible
# version on every run, which is how a nightly deprecation reached the gate.

